# File > Save Project As and Open Project: tabs, structures, cameras, the
# view settings and the look come back; a project written by the C++
# desktop (format 7, tests/golden) opens with its titles and atoms.
open docs/manual/examples/cu_fcc.cif
step replicate
set counts 2 2 2
apply
expect-atoms 32
open docs/manual/examples/sio2_pack.xyz
view style ball-and-stick
view show labels
command look along y
save-project rust/target/ui/test.afproject
close-all
expect-tabs 0
open-project rust/target/ui/test.afproject
expect-tabs 2
expect-atoms 32
expect-camera 45 35.26439
tab 2
expect-atoms 120
expect-camera 0 90
expect-bonds 52
undo
expect-atoms 120
open-project rust/tests/golden/project_v7.afproject
expect-tabs 4
expect-atoms 5
expect-status (2 tabs)
tab 4
expect-atoms 2
screenshot rust/target/ui/project.png
quit
